{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"港深車業服務違規拒見本地求職者　被罰禁聘外勞兩年\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/LD-EMPLOY-261023-17.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】港深車業服務有限公司違反輸入外勞規定，被勞工處實施行政制裁。</p><p>勞工處表示，經調查發現該公司申請輸入駕駛員在本地公開招聘期間，無合理理由的情況下，沒有按已同意的安排面見一名合資格求職者，以及向處方提交不實的本地公開招聘結果，將會即日起拒絕處理該公司隨後兩年的輸入外勞申請。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:39.875022+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:13:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T14:18:09.731302+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:39:00.716612+00:00","content_hash":"e030f3235980d5739867c0ff4697ffc4e00b8664fec6e30483f5e63a1311a8ae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:39.875022+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}